ZEkbLzgw&oe=6A749779"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "904464704380159", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974777_904464711046825_8047630676978903032_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aiVAnwQZr-0Q7kNvwFhbTn9&_nc_oc=AdqXPZHYe6rPQ4falN4fg86wwJY0aR6kIOyg-wTQjvoMmioHQurxsS9DvRUnm3SsbsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHFHcvKeC1iJp6TVHM-XhudeH58ZWzqowuPUor6ebbIWA&oe=6A74A125"}, "display_name": "Quran in VR with Audio Reading", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Step into a groundbreaking Quranic experience with our VR app on Oculus! Embrace the timeless ritual of page-flipping, seamlessly navigate Surahs, physical-like paging, and bookmark pages for a personalized journey. Tailor your exploration with number-based page navigation and zoom features. Connect intimately with the text using hand-tracking and intelligent face following. Enjoy adjustable screens and user-friendly navigation suitable for learners and experts. Immerse yourself further with a mixed-reality tea table, creating a serene backdrop for your spiritual quest. Elevate your Holy Quran exploration today, uniting tradition with cutting-edge technology. Download now on Oculus for an immersive and accessible experience.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the divine with our Quran VR app on Oculus! Experience the charm of flipping pages, physical-like Quran, navigate chapters effortlessly, and bookmark pages. With intuitive features like number-based page navigation, zoom, hand-tracking, and intelligent face following, our app caters to learners and experts. Enjoy an adjustable screen, user-friendly navigation, and a unique mixed-reality tea table experience. Elevate your Quranic journey today!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uiqAos4XAVJvlZD6rnZGk8BLKvNqdp8OYZEzLMnHfJU/edit?usp=drive_link", "developer_